{"timestamp":"2026-07-29T15:20:00Z","total_collections":11,"total_nfts":173,"version":"index-1","collections":[{"identifier":"AGR-9bd53e","name":"AlGorRhythm","type":"NonFungibleESDT","nft_count":5,"preview":[{"collection":"AGR-9bd53e","collection_name":"AlGorRhythm","nonce":5,"name":"Chemical Transformation","identifier":"AGR-9bd53e-05","url":"https://media.multiversx.com/nfts/thumbnail/AGR-9bd53e-dc625086","type":"NonFungibleESDT","creator":"erd1mmh2j5y8esv2tmmyeau3hr4xa2u2te3zc3j9wumn3v5vm8uvsczqnucj5l","owner":"","metadata":{"description":"(medium tempo swing)\r\n\r\nIt happens that under the influence of various factors we are not able to control our emotions, which can sometimes cause harm to our loved ones."},"royalties":5},{"collection":"AGR-9bd53e","collection_name":"AlGorRhythm","nonce":4,"name":"Black Black Sea","identifier":"AGR-9bd53e-04","url":"https://media.multiversx.com/nfts/thumbnail/AGR-9bd53e-5f5543e9","type":"NonFungibleESDT","creator":"erd1mmh2j5y8esv2tmmyeau3hr4xa2u2te3zc3j9wumn3v5vm8uvsczqnucj5l","owner":"","metadata":{"description":"(medium fast bossanova)\n\nI remember the Black Sea, its relatively recent calm and serenity, the gentle lapping of the waves, the bright sun and the beautiful light of the moon."},"royalties":5},{"collection":"AGR-9bd53e","collection_name":"AlGorRhythm","nonce":3,"name":"Three Steps to Success","identifier":"AGR-9bd53e-03","url":"https://media.multiversx.com/nfts/thumbnail/AGR-9bd53e-e0118f16","type":"NonFungibleESDT","creator":"erd1mmh2j5y8esv2tmmyeau3hr4xa2u2te3zc3j9wumn3v5vm8uvsczqnucj5l","owner":"","metadata":{"description":"(fast jazz waltz)\r\n\r\nOur life is often like an obstacle course where we need to rhythmically overcome difficulties, and each time it seems that it becomes more and more difficult."},"royalties":5},{"collection":"AGR-9bd53e","collection_name":"AlGorRhythm","nonce":2,"name":"Snow in New York","identifier":"AGR-9bd53e-02","url":"https://media.multiversx.com/nfts/thumbnail/AGR-9bd53e-d7c